### How to Launch Your Free Website: 🚀

1. **Create GitHub Account** (if you don't have): [github.com](https://github.com/)
2. **Create New Repository** named `asn-electrical`
3. **Upload this file**: Name it `index.html`
4. **Enable GitHub Pages**:
   - Go to Repository Settings > Pages
   - Select "main branch" as source
   - Click Save

Your website will be live at:  
`https://[your-github-username].github.io/asn-electrical`

